      "content": "it's not just a \"mistake\" though. it feels deeper than that. it's like i'm a broken part of their legacy. they see me as this success story they worked for, but i'm actually just the person who ruined the one thing they actually cared about. how am i supposed to just \"turn it around\" when the damage is already done? everything i touch just gets messed up and i feel like i'm just dragging them down with me.",
